  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Joint PFM Review Mission will take place between November 17 and 21, 2008. The main task of the first consultancy is to assist the Joint Review Team by providing technical competence and strategic guidance based on the findings during the PEFA review and to draft the aide memoire of the of the mission. The second consultancy aims at documenting the insights about the PFM Reform programme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
